MiaoHui extension for LumiLuna
==============================

This extension package is a port of MiaoHui (秒回), an offline local
content search engine, originally developed by Kian0034:
    https://github.com/Kian0034/miaohui  (MIT License)

Ported into the LumiLuna extension framework with the following changes:
  * PySide6 GUI / tray / hotkey replaced by the LumiLuna extension host
    (window, tray menu, global shortcut are contributed via manifest.json).
  * OCR unified to RapidOCR (ONNX) on all platforms; the macOS
    Apple Vision branch was removed.
  * Added engine/service.py exposing a localhost HTTP API consumed by
    the LumiLuna host via ext_invoke.
  * Data directory relocated via the MIAOHUI_SUPPORT_DIR environment
    variable to extensions/miaohui/data.

The original engine core (core/) is reused as-is under the MIT license.
This package is distributed independently from LumiLuna (GPL-3.0); the
MIT license above applies to this package and must be preserved.
